from the manufacturer of Minyak Kutus Kutus Tamba Waras, registered under official resellers.\n\nMINYAK KUTUS KUTUS is an ORGANIC HERBAL HEALING OIL made from 49 types of herbal plants, proven to aid in alleviating over 50 different ailments. Frequently used alongside medical treatments to enhance energy pathways (Chi) for accelerated recovery.\n\nHelps relieve: Gout, rheumatism, numbness, joint pain, muscle stiffness, sprains, stiff neck, pinched nerves, arthritis, muscle swelling, cramps, bruises, constipation, hemorrhoids, gastritis, bloating, sore throat, coughs, flu symptoms, fevers, vertigo, migraines, travel sickness, exhaustion, menstrual pain, and insomnia.\n\nDirections: Noticeable changes usually felt within 1 week; regular use is recommended for 2-3 months."}'
