    "detail" = '{"id":"Minyak Sereh Rejeki Jaya\r\n\r\n100% Oleum Citronella\r\n\r\nDeskripsi:\r\nOleum Citronella dikenal dengan minyak serai wangi yang mempunyai banyak manfaat bagi kesehatan tubuh secara alami.\r\n\r\nKegunaan:\r\n1. Aromatherapy\r\n2. Membantu mengusir serangga secara alami (natural pest repellent)\r\n3. Membantu relaksasi dan menciptakan sensasi yang menenangkan.\r\n4. Membantu menjaga kesehatan kaki yang disebabkan oleh jamur (anti-fungal).\r\n5. Sebagai campuran disinfektan alami untuk membersihkan perabot rumah tangga.\r\n\r\nCara pengunaan:\r\n1. Direct inhale (hirup langsung) & Diffuse menggunakan aroma diffuser (teteskan 5-10 essential oil ke dalam 300 ml air)\r\n2. Juga di oles Langsung","en":"Minyak Sereh Rejeki Jaya\n\n100% Oleum Citronella\n\nDescription:\nOleum Citronella is known as citronella oil, offering many natural benefits for body health.\n\nUses:\n1. Aromatherapy.\n2. Works as a natural insect repellent.\n3. Helps relaxation and generates a calming sensation.\n4. Helps maintain foot health against fungal issues (anti-fungal).\n5. Works as a natural disinfectant mix for household furniture cleaning.\n\nDirections:\n1. Direct inhalation or Diffuse using an aroma diffuser (add 5-10 drops into 300 ml of water).\n2. Can also be applied directly onto the skin."}'
