UPDATE "News"
SET
    "slug" = '{"id":"norwegia-dibantai-prancis-erling-haaland-mending-istirahat-di-balkon-sambil-gosok-pake-minyak-gosok-cap-beruang-roll-on","en":"norway-thrashed-by-france-erling-haaland-better-rest-on-balcony-rubbing-bear-brand-roll-on"}',
    "title" = '{"id":"Norwegia Dibantai Prancis, Erling Haaland Mending Istirahat di Balkon Sambil Gosok Pake Minyak Gosok Cap Beruang Roll-On","en":"Norway Thrashed by France, Erling Haaland Better Off Resting on the Balcony While Rubbing Bear Brand Roll-On Oil"}',
    "summary" = '{"id":"Keputusan mengejutkan pelatih Norwegia mengistirahatkan Erling Haaland berujung petaka setelah timnya digulung Prancis 1-4. Netizen pun berspekulasi sang robot mending healing pakai minyak gosok.","en":"The Norwegian coach’s shocking decision to rest Erling Haaland ended in disaster after his team was rolled 1-4 by France."}',
    "contentHtml" = '{"id":"<p><strong>JAKARTA</strong> – Keputusan pelatih Timnas Norwegia, Stale Solbakken, untuk mengistirahatkan Erling Haaland di laga terakhir Grup I Piala Dunia 2026 kontra Prancis (27/6/2026 dini hari WIB) tampaknya melahirkan sebuah penyesalan estetik.</p><p>Niat hati ingin memberikan waktu me-time bagi sang robot gol Manchester City, Solbakken justru harus menyaksikan timnya digulung habis 1-4 oleh Kylian Mbappe cs di Stadion Gillette.</p><p>Melihat rekan-rekan setimnya diacak-acak Les Bleus, Haaland yang duduk manis di bangku cadangan selama 90 menit penuh diduga kuat batinnya meronta-ronta. Daripada stres nonton timnya kena bantai tanpa bisa berbuat apa-apa, sepertinya Haaland lebih memilih skenario alternatif: Pindah ke balkon stadion, pakai sarung, sambil gosok-gosok <a href=\"/product/46\">Minyak Gosok Cap Beruang versi roll-on</a> ke jidat.</p><h2>Statistik Robot yang Butuh Healing</h2><p>Sebelum laga ini, performa Haaland sebenarnya sedang di luar nalar (seperti biasa). Bayangkan saja:</p><ul><li>Melawan Irak: Cetak 2 gol (Sambil merem mungkin).</li><li>Melawan Senegal: Cetak 2 gol lagi (Lari-lari lucu doang).</li></ul><p>Total: 4 gol dari 2 laga awal, nempel ketat Kylian Mbappe dan Lionel Messi di bursa Sepatu Emas.</p><p>Tapi, karena Norwegia sudah dipastikan lolos ke babak 32 besar berkat dua kemenangan tersebut, Solbakken mendadak punya ide kreatif: merotasi 10 pemain sekaligus!</p><p>\"Buat apa maksain Haaland main kalau cuma kejar status juara grup? Mending simpan buat babak gugur. Biarkan dia menikmati aroma angin <a href=\"/product/46\">Minyak Gosok Cap Beruang Roll On</a> dulu,\" mungkin begitu pikir sobat dalam hati.</p><p><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/djk2qql9w/image/upload/v1782630075/2_yxh2zz.jpg\" alt=\"Erling Haaland Healing\" /></p><h2>Kronologi Masuk Anginnya Pertahanan Norwegia</h2><p>Tanpa adanya Haaland di lini depan yang biasanya bikin bek lawan gemetaran sampai mules, Prancis tampil tanpa beban. Gawang Norwegia pun diberondong empat kali. 10 pemain pelapis Norwegia yang dipasang malam itu tampaknya masih kaget dan butuh penyesuaian atmosfer.</p><p>Sementara itu, kamera sesekali menyorot Haaland yang hanya bisa melongo di bench. Netizen pun mulai berspekulasi bahwa Haaland sebenarnya sudah mengalami gejala masuk angin stadium ringan akibat melihat taktik pelatihnya sendiri.</p><p>Mengingat Haaland punya rekor selalu mencetak gol dalam 12 pertandingan kompetitif terakhirnya bersama Norwegia, ego sang striker dipastikan agak lecet melihat timnya digeprek 1-4.</p><h2>Hikmah di Balik Kekalahan: Tetap Lolos, yang Penting Glowing</h2><p>Meski kalah telak dan harus puas finish sebagai runner-up Grup I dengan 6 poin (Prancis juara grup dengan 9 poin), nasib Norwegia untungnya aman terkendali. Mereka tetap melenggang ke babak 32 besar.</p><p>Jadi, bagi Haaland, duduk di bangku cadangan semalam mungkin adalah berkah tersirat. Ketimbang ototnya ketarik gara-gara buru-buru ngejar bola Prancis, mending dia fokus recovery. Tinggal oles-oles <a href=\"/product/46\">Minyak Beruang roll-on</a> yang hangatnya meresap sampai ke serat-serat sasis robotnya, tidur nyenyak, dan bersiap ngamuk lagi di babak knock-out.</p><p>Prancis boleh menang 4-1, tapi urusan kehangatan tubuh dan kesiapan mental di babak 32 besar? Haaland pemenangnya!</p>","en":"<p><strong>JAKARTA</strong> - Norway coach Stale Solbakken decided to rest Erling Haaland in the final Group I match against France. The plan was probably simple: save the goal machine for the knockout round. But the result was painful. Norway lost 1-4 to Kylian Mbappe and friends.</p><p>Haaland sat on the bench for the whole match. Watching his teammates get attacked again and again, he may have wished he was somewhere quieter, maybe on a stadium balcony, relaxing with <a href=\"/product/46\">Bear Brand Roll On Rubbing Oil</a>.</p><h2>A Goal Machine That Needed Rest</h2><p>Before this match, Haaland had been excellent. He scored two goals against Iraq and two more against Senegal. Four goals in two early matches made him one of the hottest names in the Golden Boot race.</p><p>Because Norway had already qualified for the round of 32, the coach rotated many players. The idea was logical, but France punished the second-choice squad heavily.</p><p><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/djk2qql9w/image/upload/v1782630075/2_yxh2zz.jpg\" alt=\"Erling Haaland Healing\" /></p><h2>Norway''s Defense Caught a Cold</h2><p>Without Haaland up front, France played with freedom. Norway''s defense looked confused and tired. The French attack scored four times, while Haaland could only watch from the bench.</p><p>Fans joked that the striker needed recovery time more than tactical analysis. A warm roll-on oil might be a better friend than watching a 1-4 defeat.</p><h2>The Good News: Norway Still Qualified</h2><p>Even after the heavy defeat, Norway still reached the round of 32 as runner-up with six points. France finished first with nine points.</p><p>For Haaland, the night may still be useful. He avoided injury, saved energy, and can prepare for the knockout round. Sometimes the best move is not to run, but to rest, recover, and come back stronger.</p><p>France won the match, but Haaland may still win the next battle if his body stays warm, rested, and ready.</p>"}'
WHERE "newsId" = 2
   OR "slug" = 'norwegia-dibantai-prancis-erling-haaland-mending-istirahat-di-balkon-sambil-gosok-pake-minyak-gosok-cap-beruang-roll-on'
   OR "slug" = 'norway-thrashed-by-france-erling-haaland-better-rest-on-balcony-rubbing-bear-brand-roll-on'
